    "text": "21 hours ago Martinez's two-run double in the top of the ninth blew the game open, giving the Guardians a 12-7 lead. After Friday's win over Kansas City, Martinez is now batting .260 with 18 home runs, 62 RBI, 49 runs scored, and 11 stolen bases across 112 games. He's been hot of late, hitting .400 with three homers and nine RBI in his past seven contests. Read full article",
